# South toggles A on and off; East repeats B ten times a second while held.
setup tests/scenarios/packs/input.padpack Toggle and turbo
tap south 30
advance 500
tap south 30
press east
advance 350
release east
advance 200
---
key KEY_A down @0
key KEY_A up   @530
key KEY_B down @560
key KEY_B up   @611
key KEY_B down @661
key KEY_B up   @711
key KEY_B down @761
key KEY_B up   @811
key KEY_B down @861
key KEY_B up   @910
